+            "Dark mode was requested by 62% of users who checked portfolios before bed"
+          ]
+        },
+        "solution": {
+          "approach": "We adopted a dual-layer design strategy: a clean, confidence-inspiring primary interface for common tasks (viewing portfolio, executing simple trades), and a progressive disclosure pattern for advanced features (options trading, margin accounts, risk analytics).\n\nThe design system was built mobile-first with a focus on speed: skeleton loading, optimistic UI updates, and cached data for instant rendering. We created a modular card system that could display varying levels of financial data density depending on user preference and device context.",
+          "keyFeatures": [
+            "Adaptive Dashboard with customizable widgets for portfolio performance, watchlists, and market news",
+            "One-Swipe Trade Execution with biometric confirmation and clear risk disclosure modals",
