+          "testimonial": {
+            "quote": "Rajesh understood that investment apps need to balance power with simplicity. The new design makes me feel in control of my portfolio without being overwhelmed. The risk visualizations alone changed how I think about my investments.",
+            "author": "Michael Rodriguez",
+            "role": "Retail Investor",
